---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const channels = [
  {label:'Email', value:'kaushalkumar@duck.com', href:'mailto:kaushalkumar@duck.com', note:'Best for opportunities and collaborations'},
  {label:'GitHub', value:'github.com/ratwet', href:'https://github.com/ratwet', note:'Code, experiments, and public work'},
  {label:'LinkedIn', value:'linkedin.com/in/kaushal-kumar-072739206', href:'https://linkedin.com/in/kaushal-kumar-072739206', note:'Professional profile and networking'},
];
---
<Layout title="Contact | Kaushal Kumar">
  <div class="page-intro"><span class="mono">05 / CONTACT</span><h1>Let’s talk about useful work.</h1><p>For research collaborations, engineering opportunities, mentorship, or a technical problem worth exploring, reach out directly.</p></div>
  <section class="contact-grid">
    <div class="terminal panel"><div class="terminal-head"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>kaushal@portfolio:~</span><span class="live">ONLINE</span></div><div class="terminal-body"><p><span class="prompt">$</span> whoami</p><h2>Kaushal Kumar</h2><p class="dim">Mathematics &amp; Computing · AI/ML · Systems · Robotics</p><p><span class="prompt">$</span> status</p><p class="green">Open to selected collaborations and technical opportunities.</p><p><span class="prompt">$</span> send --email</p><a class="email" href="mailto:kaushalkumar@duck.com">kaushalkumar@duck.com</a><p><span class="prompt">$</span> _</p></div></div>
    <div class="channels">{channels.map(c=><a class="channel panel" href={c.href} target={c.href.startsWith('http') ? '_blank' : undefined} rel={c.href.startsWith('http') ? 'noreferrer' : undefined}><div class="channel-top"><span>{c.label}</span><b>↗</b></div><strong>{c.value}</strong><small>{c.note}</small></a>)}</div>
  </section>
  <section class="note panel"><span class="mono">WHAT HELPS</span><p>A short note about the problem, role, project, or opportunity is enough. Concrete context makes the first conversation much more useful.</p></section>
</Layout>
<style>
.page-intro{max-width:850px;padding:38px 0 62px}.mono{font:10px 'JetBrains Mono';color:var(--blue);letter-spacing:.08em}.page-intro h1{font-size:clamp(45px,6.5vw,76px);line-height:.98;letter-spacing:-.06em;margin:13px 0}.page-intro p{max-width:720px;color:#96a2b3;font-size:14px;line-height:1.8}.contact-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.15fr .85fr;gap:11px}.panel{border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--panel);backdrop-filter:blur(14px);border-radius:17px}.terminal{overflow:hidden;background:#090d13}.terminal-head{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:11px 13px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);font:9px 'JetBrains Mono';color:#617086}.terminal-head i{width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:#273244}.terminal-head span:nth-last-child(2){margin-left:5px}.terminal-head .live{margin-left:auto;color:#66d9ad}.terminal-body{padding:23px 20px;min-height:335px;color:#c4cfda;font:11px/1.8 'JetBrains Mono'}.terminal-body p{margin:0 0 7px}.terminal-body h2{margin:0 0 3px;font:600 20px 'DM Sans'}.prompt{color:#5ee3ef}.dim{color:#69778a}.green{color:#6fe0b6}.email{color:#d5fbff}.channels{display:grid;gap:8px}.channel{padding:17px;transition:transform .2s,border-color .2s,background .2s}.channel:hover{transform:translateX(3px);border-color:rgba(124,236,255,.23);background:rgba(124,236,255,.035)}.channel-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}.channel-top span{color:var(--blue);font:9px 'JetBrains Mono'}.channel-top b{font-weight:500;color:#54bfdc}.channel strong{display:block;margin-top:13px;color:#e0e7ef;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;word-break:break-word}.channel small{display:block;margin-top:7px;color:#6f7d91;font-size:10px;line-height:1.5}.note{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:22px;margin-top:11px;padding:17px}.note p{max-width:720px;margin:0;color:#7d8b9f;font-size:11px;line-height:1.7}@media(max-width:820px){.contact-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.note{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}}
</style>
